{"seq":32,"slug":"ai-cost-token-optimization","title":"AI 成本与 Token 优化工程","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization","rating":{"composite":4.02,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-成本与-token-优化工程-简介\">AI 成本与 Token 优化工程 简介</h1><p>2026 年，企业 LLM 支出进入指数增长通道。一个看似无害的原型月花 50 美元，上线后月账单轻松飙升到 5000 美元——而 Agent 系统每任务 3-10 倍的 API 调用量让这个数字再翻一个数量级。价格下降了 99%，用量却暴涨了 1000 倍。多数团队的推理成本不是在降，而是在失控地上升。</p>\n<p>成本优化不是省钱。它是一门工程学科——需要精确计量、分层路由、缓存复用、架构选型和持续治理，每一层都有明确的输入输出和可量化的效果。这与&quot;Prompt 写短一点&quot;的朴素建议不在同一维度。</p>\n<p>本 hub 构建完整的 LLM 成本效率工程体系。四个章节覆盖从认知到实践的全链路。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>基础</strong>，建立成本意识的底层认知：2026 年全球推理市场的定价结构与趋势（旗舰/中坚/轻量三级金字塔）；Token 作为计量单元的经济学本质（输入/输出/缓存/思考 Token 的差异定价，有效成本公式）；成本架构的系统设计视角（成本从哪些层面累积，以及在哪些节点可以干预）。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>优化策略</strong>，给出三个投产比最高的降本杠杆：Prompt 压缩与 Token 工程（系统 Prompt 瘦身、上下文管理、输出控制）；模型路由与级联（难度感知路由、cascade 模式、advisor 策略）；缓存与去重（Prompt Cache、语义缓存、请求去重复）。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>基础设施</strong>，处理架构层面的成本决策：批处理与异步模式（Batch API、队列化、非实时场景的 50% 折扣）；自建推理 vs API 采购的 TCO 分析（何时自建划算、隐性成本、混合架构）；量化与蒸馏带来的成本收益（小模型替代大模型的工程路径）。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>治理</strong>，确保优化成果可持续：成本可观测性（计量中间件、多维归因、异常检测）；预算分配与熔断（团队/项目/用户粒度的配额管理）；ROI 度量（质量-成本帕累托前沿、投资回报的量化框架）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>聚焦</th>\n<th>何时需要它</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>AI 成本与 Token 优化工程</strong>（本 hub）</td>\n<td>推理成本的工程优化——计量、路由、缓存、架构、治理</td>\n<td>想把 LLM 账单降 40-80% 且不牺牲质量的工程师</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt 工程模式（30_）</td>\n<td>Prompt 的结构、写法模式与工程化</td>\n<td>关注 Prompt 本身质量，而非成本维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评测驱动 AI 工程（20_）</td>\n<td>质量评测体系——eval 框架与基准</td>\n<td>关注如何衡量模型输出质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测性与错误处理（16_）</td>\n<td>通用的可观测性架构</td>\n<td>需要日志/tracing/alerting 的系统级方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本 hub 的核心区分在于<strong>成本效率</strong>。Prompt 工程关注&quot;写得好不好&quot;，评测工程关注&quot;输出对不对&quot;，本 hub 关注&quot;花得值不值&quot;——以及如何用系统化的工程手段，在保持质量约束的前提下最小化推理支出。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>使用过 LLM API（OpenAI/Anthropic/国产模型均可），理解 token 是什么</li>\n<li>有基本的后端开发经验，能读懂 Python/TypeScript 代码</li>\n<li>对&quot;为什么我的 LLM 月账单越来越高&quot;有切身体会——这正是本 hub 要解决的问题</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"成本基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-cost-landscape","title":"AI 推理成本全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/foundations/ai-cost-landscape"},{"seq":2,"slug":"token-economics","title":"Token 经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/foundations/token-economics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-architecture","title":"成本架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/foundations/cost-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization","title":"优化策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prompt-compression","title":"Prompt 压缩与 Token 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/prompt-compression"},{"seq":2,"slug":"model-routing-cascading","title":"模型路由与级联","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/model-routing-cascading"},{"seq":3,"slug":"caching-deduplication","title":"缓存与去重策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/caching-deduplication"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"infrastructure","title":"基础设施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"batch-async-patterns","title":"批处理与异步模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/batch-async-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-hosted-vs-api","title":"自建推理 vs API 采购","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/self-hosted-vs-api"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantization-distillation-cost","title":"量化与蒸馏的成本收益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/quantization-distillation-cost"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance","title":"成本治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-observability","title":"成本可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/governance/cost-observability"},{"seq":2,"slug":"budget-allocation","title":"预算分配与熔断机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/governance/budget-allocation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"roi-measurement","title":"ROI 度量与优化决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/governance/roi-measurement"}]}]}